    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>As a Bonus Action, you can turn this walking cane into an ordinary @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepLongsword0]{Longsword} or turn the Longsword back into a cane. Either way, you must be holding the item.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-yFdEKRRLa6EVYvbj\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>L’arme a l’attaque d’une épée longue, à utiliser sous cette forme ; <em>Transform</em> rappelle le changement de forme.</p></section>",
